# Libraries (fetched by packager via .pkgmeta externals), EXCEPT the vendored
# Foundry-1.0 embed (HS-120): it is tracked so it ships in every build (CF, Wago,
# and the local dev tree), so embeds.xml never references absent files. A
# standalone Foundry-1.0, when installed, still wins via the guarded embed.
Libs/*
!Libs/Foundry-1.0/

